== 3. all local maxima of the exact likelihood (gauss_n8; grid scan + polish) ==
columns: ll, g0, g1 = the polished maximum; grid_edge = 1 if the scan max sat on the box edge;
 max_abs_grad / max_eig = gradient and largest Hessian eigenvalue of P there (local max: ~0 and < 0);
 min_ls / max_ls = fitted log sigma range; b0, b1 = the mean line at that maximum.
